After the recent full-resolution fix, I attached an image and tapped it to open fullscreen.

Instead of opening within a reasonable time, the viewer stayed on the loading spinner for several minutes and never displayed the image.

This is unacceptable.

Do NOT revert to using the blurry thumbnail as the final image.

We need BOTH:

1. fast preview opening;
2. eventual full-resolution image.

